    "created_at": "2017-11-23T00:18:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-11-23T00:18:52Z",
    "body": "I think it’s just that `sizes` predates retina displays. \r\n\r\nFWIW, we did do a lot of research as part of manifest. What we found is that beyond 2x it doesn’t matter. People can’t really distinguish pixels beyond 2x, so at that point SVG or just a large image is better. ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
