    "created_at": "2017-11-23T08:42:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-11-23T08:42:24Z",
    "body": "That would depend on the viewing distance, no? 2x vs 3x vs 4x seems relevant for VR at least, and potentially desktop monitors too. And given the trend in phones it likely matters there too.\r\n\r\nPer https://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/public-whatwg-archive/2008May/0071.html it does indeed seem that density was not yet a consideration.",
