    "created_at": "2017-11-23T09:00:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-11-23T09:00:32Z",
    "body": "I'm somewhat surprised by that conclusion for manifests given it's far from widely deployed thus far and `<picture>` and `srcset` do have density. @marcoscaceres can you point to the issue and PR surrounding the removal?",
